WEBVTT

00:00:14.292 --> 00:00:15.833
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:15.833 --> 00:00:20.625
<i>Between us half-demon twins,</i>
<i>two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.708 --> 00:00:23.167
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.458 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.125
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.458 --> 00:00:28.833
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.292 --> 00:00:30.708
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:31.042 --> 00:00:32.500
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:35.500
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.667
<i>A Feudal Fairytale,</i>
<i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.667 --> 00:00:43.500
<i>We'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:52.125 --> 00:00:53.500
ONE OF THE FOUR PERILS – KONTON

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:54.750
Lord Konton.

00:00:56.333 --> 00:00:59.000
I, Nikosen, have arrived.

00:00:59.667 --> 00:01:02.542
FORMER SAGE – NIKOSEN
I've heard that you mastered

00:01:02.542 --> 00:01:05.667
a human craft before becoming
an apparition, but is that true?

00:01:06.167 --> 00:01:07.542
Just so.

00:01:08.042 --> 00:01:10.208
Then please, show me a dance.

00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:11.708
A dance?

00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:15.583
Here are the half-demons
who possess Rainbow Pearls.

00:01:16.208 --> 00:01:17.625
Half-demons?

00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:25.042
I heard they were beings born between
a human and a demon.

00:01:25.750 --> 00:01:27.583
How distasteful.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:31.583
Some mere half-demons
have the Rainbow Pearls?

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.958
Indeed. So distasteful.

00:01:35.458 --> 00:01:40.875
I see, so you think that I, Nikosen,
being both demon and human,

00:01:40.875 --> 00:01:43.542
am best suited to take care of them.

00:01:43.542 --> 00:01:47.208
As you say, I shall dance brilliantly for you.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.917
I hope you create an excellent show.

00:03:35.292 --> 00:03:38.167
"Night of the New Moon
and the Black-haired Towa"

00:03:41.208 --> 00:03:43.000
Another request?

00:03:43.292 --> 00:03:47.500
Yeah. Apparently, a demon
named Nikosen dried up a mountain,

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:50.000
so the nearby villagers are spooked.

00:03:50.208 --> 00:03:52.125
Could you take care of it, Setsuna?

00:03:52.125 --> 00:03:55.208
TOWA          SETSUNA
We can't ignore the villagers if they need help.

00:03:55.208 --> 00:03:56.667
Right, Setsuna?

00:03:57.833 --> 00:04:00.375
LEADER OF DEMON SLAYERS – KOHAKU
I'll have Hisui join you later.

00:04:00.708 --> 00:04:03.833
If it's your order, Chief,
then I have no objections.

00:04:06.958 --> 00:04:09.042
I know, I know.

00:04:09.042 --> 00:04:11.250
CAT DEMON – KIRARA
Let's go together, Kirara.

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:24.292
I have taken plenty of nutrients
from the mountain and trees.

00:04:24.875 --> 00:04:28.792
Now I just have to wait for
those half-demons to show up.

00:04:30.375 --> 00:04:31.833
It's that mountain.

00:04:33.417 --> 00:04:36.792
The plants have dried up
in a really strange way.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.542
And the color of the soil is weird, too.

00:04:40.417 --> 00:04:42.250
We're getting off. There's a guest.

00:04:42.333 --> 00:04:43.833
Huh? Who is it?

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.583
BOUNTY HUNTER– MOROHA

00:04:46.583 --> 00:04:47.750
<i>I see.</i>

00:04:48.083 --> 00:04:51.417
<i>This is poison, but it's not</i>
<i>the poison from an apparition.</i>

00:04:52.208 --> 00:04:54.750
<i>Looks like the nutrients</i>
<i>have been sucked away from it.</i>

00:04:54.750 --> 00:04:57.583
As you can see, the trees are all bare.

00:04:57.708 --> 00:04:59.708
Yeah, this is pretty horrible.

00:05:00.375 --> 00:05:02.667
Do you know who could've done this?

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.417
I think it got destroyed by
a demon's poison.

00:05:05.417 --> 00:05:07.750
It's definitely the work of Nikosen.

00:05:09.042 --> 00:05:12.333
<i>Looks like I'm gonna score big this time.</i>

00:05:12.583 --> 00:05:13.750
Hey!

00:05:14.042 --> 00:05:15.542
Moroha!

00:05:19.333 --> 00:05:21.292
What're you guys doing here?

00:05:21.417 --> 00:05:23.458
Are you here to slay Nikosen, too?

00:05:23.458 --> 00:05:24.583
Wait, don't tell me.

00:05:24.792 --> 00:05:26.458
We received orders to slay it.

00:05:27.458 --> 00:05:31.292
Oh man, are we going to have to
split the bounty again?

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:35.917
The plants look more withered
the higher we climb.

00:05:36.542 --> 00:05:40.417
And I can smell rotting soil
from the top of the mountain.

00:05:40.417 --> 00:05:41.458
Yeah.

00:05:41.458 --> 00:05:44.458
I heard that Nikosen used to be
a sage a long time ago,

00:05:44.458 --> 00:05:49.625
but wicked thoughts made him stray
from his path and turn into an apparition.

00:05:49.958 --> 00:05:51.083
Keep your guard up.

00:05:51.417 --> 00:05:54.125
The smell of rotting soil
is getting stronger.

00:05:54.125 --> 00:05:56.958
No need to bother stating the obvious.

00:05:56.958 --> 00:05:58.875
What? Really?

00:05:58.875 --> 00:06:00.958
You don't feel the demon energy?

00:06:02.333 --> 00:06:04.500
That's right, I don't sense anything.

00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.000
<i>Her heart beat is faster than usual.</i>

00:06:11.458 --> 00:06:15.250
<i>Even with this hill's incline,</i>
<i>she shouldn't be out of breath.</i>

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:22.125
I've been waiting for you, half-demons.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.167
There you are, Nikosen.

00:06:25.042 --> 00:06:26.125
Prepare to die!

00:06:28.083 --> 00:06:29.000
Huh?

00:06:31.458 --> 00:06:32.833
Wait, why...

00:06:33.167 --> 00:06:34.333
Stay back, Towa.

00:06:34.667 --> 00:06:39.333
How impudent for half-demons
to possess the Rainbow Pearls.

00:06:41.667 --> 00:06:46.708
This is bad. That's sage venom.
You two are going to get hurt really bad.

00:06:46.708 --> 00:06:47.875
Towa, use this.

00:06:53.208 --> 00:06:54.333
Towa.

00:06:57.708 --> 00:06:58.875
Leave this to me.

00:06:59.167 --> 00:07:00.208
I appreciate it.

00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:07.167
It's not going through.

00:07:07.458 --> 00:07:11.833
You fool. Such a dull sword
will not work on me!

00:07:19.208 --> 00:07:20.208
Are you all right?

00:07:21.500 --> 00:07:22.333
Sorry.

00:07:22.833 --> 00:07:25.875
I'm just getting in your way, aren't I?

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.000
<i>The smell of her blood</i>
<i>flowing within her is changing.</i>

00:07:30.708 --> 00:07:34.375
<i>What's wrong with Towa today?</i>

00:07:35.583 --> 00:07:37.000
Hey.

00:07:37.000 --> 00:07:40.083
Setsuna, can I borrow
one of those protective masks, too?

00:07:40.583 --> 00:07:43.583
I can't put all my strength into
Kurikaramaru with just one arm.

00:07:45.208 --> 00:07:46.083
I don't have extra.

00:07:46.542 --> 00:07:47.750
Use mine.

00:07:48.083 --> 00:07:50.583
Are you sure? If it's poison in the air...

00:07:50.833 --> 00:07:52.083
It's fine, just use it.

00:07:57.750 --> 00:07:59.083
Thanks for waiting!

00:07:59.583 --> 00:08:06.250
Now, let's see and find out if this
Kurikaramaru really is as dull as you say!

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:10.125
It's useless no matter
how many times you try.

00:08:16.833 --> 00:08:20.625
I did it! That bounty is mine!

00:08:21.958 --> 00:08:22.875
What?

00:08:24.083 --> 00:08:25.875
I won't give you my head.

00:08:26.292 --> 00:08:28.458
Heavenly Arrow Barrage!

00:08:32.458 --> 00:08:34.583
All right, this time I got you!

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:39.958
What? You gotta be kidding me.

00:08:43.042 --> 00:08:44.625
I can't believe him.

00:08:47.292 --> 00:08:50.333
I'll finish him off. Take care of Towa.

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:52.833
All right. Leave her to me.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.625
Hang in there.

00:09:02.292 --> 00:09:04.667
Once we cross this bridge
and go down the hill,

00:09:04.667 --> 00:09:06.750
we'll reach the nearby village.

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:10.500
Just a bit longer. Hang in there.

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:22.250
We defeated Nikosen, so why
is the sage venom still lingering?

00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:26.625
That's because...

00:09:26.958 --> 00:09:29.625
I'm alive and well.

00:09:31.042 --> 00:09:32.333
But...

00:09:36.333 --> 00:09:40.875
Now, give me that
Gold Rainbow Pearl of yours!

00:09:41.458 --> 00:09:43.167
Cyclone Burst!

00:09:46.708 --> 00:09:50.000
Damn you!

00:09:52.208 --> 00:09:54.125
Scourge of Swallows!

00:09:58.667 --> 00:10:00.167
What? An illusion?

00:10:00.375 --> 00:10:03.875
Oh, no. Nikosen's core
must be his torso!

00:10:04.208 --> 00:10:06.333
Sorry, Kirara, but we have to hurry.

00:10:16.917 --> 00:10:19.833
I see, so you grew a new head, huh?

00:10:21.250 --> 00:10:22.833
Were you surprised?

00:10:23.250 --> 00:10:29.875
Well, your head's like an endless bounty,
so as long as I catch you,

00:10:29.875 --> 00:10:33.083
I can keep receiving a bounty forever!

00:10:33.167 --> 00:10:37.167
And that means I can
pay back my debt in no time!

00:10:37.333 --> 00:10:39.208
What are you talking about?

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:43.375
Nikosen! I'll cut you a good deal,
so let's work together.

00:10:43.417 --> 00:10:45.417
Stop spouting nonsense!

00:10:45.417 --> 00:10:50.042
Take your complaints to your own
head-regenerating body, you weirdo!

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.042
You fool!

00:10:55.208 --> 00:10:57.958
Towa? What's with your hair?

00:10:58.375 --> 00:11:00.583
Hey, you! What did you do to Towa!

00:11:00.667 --> 00:11:03.958
Hell if I know!

00:11:13.833 --> 00:11:16.292
Well, isn't this quite interesting...

00:11:18.542 --> 00:11:20.542
Kirara, please hurry.

00:11:23.458 --> 00:11:24.500
That's...

00:11:26.000 --> 00:11:27.000
Setsuna!

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:29.542
Hisui. Chief.

00:11:43.875 --> 00:11:45.667
What happened to you, Towa?

00:11:46.375 --> 00:11:49.333
Her hair's color and length both changed.

00:11:49.833 --> 00:11:51.667
I don't sense any demon energy.

00:11:52.083 --> 00:11:54.542
It's like she's a human or something.

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:57.708
Oh, that's right.

00:11:57.792 --> 00:11:59.542
In times like these...

00:12:00.333 --> 00:12:04.208
Here it is. Hey, Grandpa Myoga!

00:12:04.208 --> 00:12:07.417
Maybe it's time I put on my rouge...

00:12:09.667 --> 00:12:11.167
There you are.

00:12:11.708 --> 00:12:15.167
Did I hear you say that you'll be
using your rouge, Lady Moroha?

00:12:18.625 --> 00:12:21.375
FLEA DEMON – MYOGA
Oh, it looks like you haven't yet.

00:12:22.083 --> 00:12:26.583
Before that, there's something
I want to ask you.

00:12:28.542 --> 00:12:29.958
You've woken up.

00:12:30.042 --> 00:12:32.250
Moroha, where are we?

00:12:33.375 --> 00:12:35.375
Oh my goodness.

00:12:35.375 --> 00:12:37.625
Lady Towa, that black hair...

00:12:40.375 --> 00:12:41.750
I see.

00:12:42.208 --> 00:12:45.375
There's no mistaking it,
we're in the middle of a New Moon.

00:12:45.375 --> 00:12:46.375
New Moon?

00:12:46.875 --> 00:12:52.125
It is when the demon power
flowing through your blood is lost.

00:12:52.875 --> 00:12:56.042
The New Moon is different
depending on the half-demon.

00:12:56.042 --> 00:12:59.958
There are half-demons like Naraku
who can decide on their own,

00:12:59.958 --> 00:13:03.083
and those like you,
who revert back to a human being

00:13:03.083 --> 00:13:06.708
on a moonless night of the New Moon.

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:12.250
But this never happened to me
when I was in the other world.

00:13:13.583 --> 00:13:19.125
That may be because
you are originally from this world.

00:13:19.625 --> 00:13:22.250
But I've never had to go through this.

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:23.083
Let's see.

00:13:23.458 --> 00:13:26.333
I can't say much since
there are few precedents,

00:13:26.333 --> 00:13:28.792
but perhaps, as a quarter-demon,

00:13:28.875 --> 00:13:31.833
Lady Moroha does not
experience the New Moon.

00:13:32.083 --> 00:13:35.750
What about Setsuna?
With the same blood running through us,

00:13:35.750 --> 00:13:38.917
would she lose
her demon powers like I did?

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:42.208
Well, since Lady Setsuna
is also a half-demon,

00:13:42.292 --> 00:13:45.958
she cannot escape from
the laws of the New Moon.

00:13:46.292 --> 00:13:49.292
Oh, no. Moroha, where's Setsuna?

00:13:49.333 --> 00:13:51.792
She went to go after Nikosen's head.

00:13:52.583 --> 00:13:56.458
There's no way
she can slay demons in this state.

00:13:56.458 --> 00:14:00.500
Indeed. On the night
of the New Moon,

00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:05.042
half-demons tend to lie low
to avoid encountering others.

00:14:05.042 --> 00:14:06.167
I need to help her.

00:14:06.458 --> 00:14:07.667
Sorry!

00:14:09.833 --> 00:14:11.458
Just stay here and rest.

00:14:12.292 --> 00:14:16.333
Grandpa Myoga, you're peerless when
it comes to hiding and running away.

00:14:16.333 --> 00:14:17.958
You have a plan, right?

00:14:18.125 --> 00:14:19.292
Huh?

00:14:19.667 --> 00:14:23.333
A way for Towa to safely pass
the day of the New Moon!

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.000
Okay.

00:14:32.000 --> 00:14:34.292
I need one more please, Grandpa Myoga.

00:14:37.167 --> 00:14:40.000
Rolling, rolling, words on paper.

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:42.167
Here it is, Lady Moroha.

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:44.833
Please imbue it with spirit power.

00:14:45.583 --> 00:14:48.250
All right, leave it to me.

00:14:56.292 --> 00:14:58.083
And now I've created a barrier.

00:15:03.667 --> 00:15:04.917
Why?

00:15:04.917 --> 00:15:06.542
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU – HISUI
What is it, Setsuna?

00:15:06.542 --> 00:15:08.083
It's strange.

00:15:08.083 --> 00:15:11.042
I can't sense Towa or
Moroha's demon energy.

00:15:11.042 --> 00:15:12.917
I can't even smell them.

00:15:12.917 --> 00:15:14.750
How is that even possible?

00:15:15.333 --> 00:15:18.917
I don't know.
But I need to hurry and find them.

00:15:20.875 --> 00:15:22.750
Hey, Grandpa Myoga.

00:15:23.167 --> 00:15:24.750
Will this barrier be enough?

00:15:25.417 --> 00:15:27.417
After all, we're up against Nikosen.

00:15:27.417 --> 00:15:29.750
He may have technically been a sage,

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:32.292
but those who stray toward a path of evil

00:15:32.292 --> 00:15:36.042
should not be able to sense
through this wall of spirit energy.

00:15:39.417 --> 00:15:44.542
How peculiar.
They should've fallen here somewhere...

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:49.083
But since I can't find their corpses,
something doesn't seem right.

00:15:50.458 --> 00:15:51.625
Chief!

00:15:52.917 --> 00:15:55.083
I can't find Towa or Moroha anywhere.

00:15:55.083 --> 00:15:59.083
With those two, there should be
nothing to worry about, but...

00:15:59.083 --> 00:16:01.250
Chief, preparations are done.

00:16:01.583 --> 00:16:03.333
DEMON SLAYERS – ROKUTA, NANASUKE
We can shoot anytime.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:07.083
Maybe we should wait
a little bit longer...

00:16:07.083 --> 00:16:09.250
Chief, please begin.

00:16:09.292 --> 00:16:12.750
If anything happens to those two,
I'll rush there immediately.

00:16:13.083 --> 00:16:15.375
I see. All right.

00:16:15.583 --> 00:16:16.458
Light it up!

00:16:16.458 --> 00:16:17.458
Yes, sir.

00:16:21.208 --> 00:16:22.917
What's that?

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.083
Fire!

00:16:31.292 --> 00:16:32.500
Wh-What?

00:16:39.958 --> 00:16:42.167
Who the hell are they?

00:16:42.542 --> 00:16:45.708
When we approached,
sage venom was whirling up.

00:16:45.708 --> 00:16:49.625
So we decided that burning down
the entire mountain is much faster.

00:16:49.625 --> 00:16:50.667
That's true.

00:17:01.292 --> 00:17:03.167
It's gotten kind of hot.

00:17:03.625 --> 00:17:05.042
A forest fire, huh?

00:17:05.958 --> 00:17:06.958
Towa.

00:17:07.208 --> 00:17:11.833
I think Setsuna and the demon slayers
have all met up.

00:17:12.083 --> 00:17:13.708
Towa, sorry I knocked you out.

00:17:13.958 --> 00:17:16.167
It's fine, I understand.

00:17:16.167 --> 00:17:18.667
But if the demon slayers are all here,

00:17:18.667 --> 00:17:23.708
they sure started an uncharacteristically
flashy way to slay the demon.

00:17:29.833 --> 00:17:31.708
I sensed them just now.

00:17:32.375 --> 00:17:35.000
Shit, the barrier's disappearing!

00:17:35.167 --> 00:17:37.042
It's all right, Moroha.

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:42.583
I think it's bad for me to keep running.
I'm going to go look for Setsuna.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.542
What're you talking about?

00:17:44.542 --> 00:17:49.250
Even if you go out there with no demon power,
you'll just be dragging them down.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.750
But, I think Setsuna's going through
the same thing.

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:57.542
On a night like tonight,
she's probably filled with worry.

00:17:57.917 --> 00:18:00.167
You might be wrong about that.

00:18:01.250 --> 00:18:06.500
Setsuna has been managing herself
just fine in this era so far.

00:18:06.917 --> 00:18:08.417
That's not true.

00:18:08.417 --> 00:18:12.375
No matter what era you live in,
what girls feel will never change!

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:17.208
"What girls feel"?
Never thought I'd hear you say that.

00:18:17.208 --> 00:18:18.708
Is it?

00:18:21.208 --> 00:18:23.625
There you are!

00:18:25.208 --> 00:18:27.375
Towa, stay back.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:32.625
I've been waiting for you, Nikosen.
My key to an endless bounty!

00:18:32.917 --> 00:18:36.083
Stop saying ridiculous things!

00:18:39.958 --> 00:18:41.625
Don't make me laugh!

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:49.750
What is this?

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:51.125
It's solidifying.

00:18:54.125 --> 00:18:55.125
Towa.

00:18:56.583 --> 00:18:59.500
I definitely just heard Towa scream.

00:18:59.500 --> 00:19:00.500
Towa!

00:19:05.542 --> 00:19:08.792
First, I'll get these two to Lord Konton.

00:19:11.583 --> 00:19:14.292
Scourge of Swallows!

00:19:25.458 --> 00:19:26.792
Towa, Moroha.

00:19:27.458 --> 00:19:28.667
Setsuna!

00:19:28.667 --> 00:19:30.958
Is that you, Towa?

00:19:30.958 --> 00:19:33.042
Of course I am! Look closely.

00:19:33.125 --> 00:19:35.208
But the more I look...

00:19:35.208 --> 00:19:38.000
More importantly,
are you okay, Setsuna?

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:39.250
What?

00:19:39.250 --> 00:19:42.292
There's no moon out tonight,
so it's the New Moon.

00:19:42.667 --> 00:19:43.958
And?

00:19:43.958 --> 00:19:46.167
You didn't return to a normal girl?

00:19:46.625 --> 00:19:48.042
What do you mean?

00:19:48.625 --> 00:19:52.958
Oh, I guess since the Dream Butterfly
has stolen her dreams,

00:19:52.958 --> 00:19:56.625
moonless nights and New Moons
don't apply to her.

00:19:56.917 --> 00:19:59.000
I see, the New Moon.

00:19:59.375 --> 00:20:02.583
I thought Towa's condition
had been strange since evening,

00:20:02.833 --> 00:20:04.625
so that's what it was.

00:20:04.708 --> 00:20:09.667
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry
for troubling everyone like this.

00:20:13.667 --> 00:20:14.542
What?

00:20:14.625 --> 00:20:15.875
No way.

00:20:16.625 --> 00:20:18.833
He's still alive.

00:20:23.333 --> 00:20:28.500
If I swallow you whole, I will get
the nutrients of a young half-demon.

00:20:32.167 --> 00:20:34.667
What? What happened?

00:20:45.583 --> 00:20:48.208
Hey, are you two hurt?

00:20:49.208 --> 00:20:50.917
Thanks for waiting, everyone.

00:20:51.125 --> 00:20:52.417
Towa!

00:20:52.875 --> 00:20:55.292
Okay, let's begin the counter attack!

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:15.042
How could this be... For me to...

00:21:15.667 --> 00:21:18.708
By mere half-demons...

00:21:33.917 --> 00:21:36.708
Both the head and body are gone...

00:21:36.708 --> 00:21:40.292
There goes my lucky plan
for an endless bounty...

00:21:40.625 --> 00:21:42.750
It wouldn't have been possible anyway.

00:21:43.083 --> 00:21:47.000
There's no way that Mr. Jyubei
wouldn't notice the sleight of hand.

00:21:47.292 --> 00:21:50.000
Yeah. I guess you're right.

00:21:50.625 --> 00:21:53.750
Damn it!

00:21:56.833 --> 00:22:03.833
So half-demons have New Moons.
I see. This is entertaining.

00:22:07.417 --> 00:22:10.125
That was a good show.

00:23:43.083 --> 00:23:44.042
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:44.042 --> 00:23:47.875
A demon has appeared that attacks
virtuous monks and Shinto priests.

00:23:47.875 --> 00:23:50.208
Hisui, please go to Brother's side.

00:23:50.208 --> 00:23:52.542
I see. That person is Monk Miroku.

00:23:52.542 --> 00:23:55.833
He wants to attain divine power
through one thousand–day training,

00:23:55.833 --> 00:23:57.583
but I doubt it'll go that smoothly.

00:23:57.625 --> 00:23:59.625
Totetsu, one of the Four Perils, appears!

00:23:59.625 --> 00:24:02.083
Will he eat anything with that big mouth?!

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:05.833
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon</i>:
"The Delicious Feudal Monks"

00:24:05.833 --> 00:24:23.979
Now, I hope you taste good.
Thank you for the meal!
